description = Color([PAWN_nameDef] designed combat modifications for frontline soldiers.\n\nOne night, in a nightmare, [PAWN_nameDef] was confronted by all the men and women killed by [PAWN_possessive] work. [PAWN_pronoun] decided to travel to the rimworlds and use [PAWN_possessive] skills for good., 1.0)
